<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>character selection macro (can be used for auto farm)</Major>
    <Description>This macro is like a digital assistant for your character selection process. Instead of manually navigating through the menus, this set of predefined commands automates the whole selection ordeal. It's like having a virtual assistant that swiftly moves through the operator roster, highlighting your preferred choice, and confirming the selection with the precision of a seasoned gamer.

works for any screen res by editing the tab size but works best on 1080x1920</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
